{
  "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.34,
      "size": 53424,
      "text": "立方体有六个面、八个顶点。正八面体正好反过来：八个面、六个顶点。这不是巧合。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.29,
      "size": 52560,
      "text": "把一个多面体的每个面换成一个顶点、每个顶点换成一个面，棱保持不变，得到的就是它的对偶。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.02,
      "size": 48384,
      "text": "屏幕上蓝色是立方体，橙色是它的对偶。两者的棱互相垂直穿插，卡在一起。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "polar",
      "line_id": "pl-1",
      "filename": "polar-pl-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/polar-pl-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.63,
      "size": 42048,
      "text": "具体做法叫极反演。以半径 R 的球为镜子，每个面变成一个顶点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "polar",
      "line_id": "pl-2",
      "filename": "polar-pl-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/polar-pl-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.78,
      "size": 44496,
      "text": "新顶点在面法向上，距原点 R 平方除以 d，这里 d 是原点到那个面的距离。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "polar",
      "line_id": "pl-3",
      "filename": "polar-pl-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/polar-pl-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.14,
      "size": 50256,
      "text": "所以面离得越近，对偶顶点就越远。屏幕上的读数验证了这个乘积恒等于 R 平方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "euler",
      "line_id": "eu-1",
      "filename": "euler-eu-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/euler-eu-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.21,
      "size": 35280,
      "text": "既然面和顶点互换、棱数不变，那么欧拉公式两边都该成立。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "euler",
      "line_id": "eu-2",
      "filename": "euler-eu-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/euler-eu-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.53,
      "size": 56448,
      "text": "立方体是八减十二加六等于二；对偶后是六减十二加八，还是二。加法可交换，所以必然相等。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "euler",
      "line_id": "eu-3",
      "filename": "euler-eu-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/euler-eu-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.81,
      "size": 44928,
      "text": "请依次切换五种立体，看左上角的读数。原体和对偶的欧拉数永远都是二。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "pairs",
      "line_id": "pr-1",
      "filename": "pairs-pr-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/pairs-pr-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.01,
      "size": 48096,
      "text": "五种柏拉图立体分成三对。立方体和正八面体一对，十二面体和二十面体一对。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "pairs",
      "line_id": "pr-2",
      "filename": "pairs-pr-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/pairs-pr-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54000,
      "text": "正四面体比较特殊，它的对偶还是正四面体，叫自对偶。四个面四个顶点，本来就对称。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "pairs",
      "line_id": "pr-3",
      "filename": "pairs-pr-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/pairs-pr-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.54,
      "size": 56592,
      "text": "十二面体二十个顶点十二个面，二十面体正好倒过来。屏幕上切换看，两者的读数确实互换了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "midsphere",
      "line_id": "md-1",
      "filename": "midsphere-md-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/midsphere-md-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.34,
      "size": 37440,
      "text": "还有个漂亮的细节。正多面体存在一个中球，与所有棱都相切。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "midsphere",
      "line_id": "md-2",
      "filename": "midsphere-md-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/midsphere-md-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.47,
      "size": 55584,
      "text": "如果极反演就用这个中球做镜子，那么对偶的棱与原来的棱不但垂直，交点还恰好落在球面上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "midsphere",
      "line_id": "md-3",
      "filename": "midsphere-md-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/midsphere-md-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.25,
      "size": 67968,
      "text": "屏幕上灰色那个球就是中球。请打开它，看两组棱如何在球面上交叉卡住。垂直度读数是十的负十六次方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "involution",
      "line_id": "iv-1",
      "filename": "involution-iv-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/involution-iv-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.47,
      "size": 55584,
      "text": "最后一个性质：对偶的对偶就是自己。用同一个球做两次极反演，会精确回到出发的多面体。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "involution",
      "line_id": "iv-2",
      "filename": "involution-iv-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/involution-iv-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.66,
      "size": 58608,
      "text": "这在数学上叫对合，就像取两次倒数、翻两次面。屏幕上的偏差读数是十的负十六次方，等于零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "involution",
      "line_id": "iv-3",
      "filename": "involution-iv-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/involution-iv-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.51,
      "size": 40176,
      "text": "所以对偶不是把多面体变成别的东西，而是换一个角度看同一个结构。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.77,
      "size": 44352,
      "text": "第一，对偶把面换成顶点、顶点换成面，棱数不变，欧拉数两边都是二。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.78,
      "size": 44496,
      "text": "第二，极反演的规则是新顶点距原点 R 平方除以面距，面越近顶点越远。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "dual-polyhedra",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/dual-polyhedra/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.82,
      "size": 61056,
      "text": "第三，五种柏拉图立体分三对，正四面体自对偶，而对偶的对偶回到自己。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
